{"strongs": "H4289", "word": "מַחְתָּה", "translit": "mach.tah", "root": "מחת", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "fire-holder, censer, snuffdish", "definition": "מַחְתָּה noun feminine fire-holder, censer, snuffdish ; — absolute ׳ מ Lev 16:12 ; Num 17:11 suffix מַחְתָּתוֺ Lev 10:1 + 4 t.; plural absolute מַחְתּוֺת Num 16:6 + 4 t.; מַחְתֹּת Num 16:17 + 3 t.; construct מַחְתּוֺת Num 17:3 ; Num 17:4 suffix מַחְתֹּתָיו Exod 27:3 מַחְתֹּתֶיהָ Exod 25:38 + 2 t; — 1. snuff-holder , snuff-dish ( Now Archäol. ii, 63. 65 ) of gold Exod 25:38 ; Exod 37:23 ; Num 4:9 (all P ). 2. bronze utensils, fire-pans , belonging to altar of burnt-offerings Exod 27:3 ; Exod 38:3 , compare Num 4:14 (all P ); fire-pans of gold 1Kgs 7:50 = 2Chr 4:22 ; 2Kgs 25:15 = Jer 52:19 . 3. censer , Lev 10:1 ; Lev 16:12 ; Num 16:6 ; Num 16:17 (4 t. in verse); Num 16:18 ; Num 17:2 ; Num 17:3 ; Num 17:4 (of bronze), v. Num 16:11 (all P ). חִתָּה , חַתְחַת see below חתת .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3246')\">BDB3246</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H4289')\">H4289</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3245')\">BDB3245</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3247')\">BDB3247</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>מַחְתָּה</bdbheb> <b>noun feminine</b> <highlightword>fire-holder, censer, snuffdish</highlightword>; — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 16:12\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(3,16,12)\">Lev 16:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 17:11\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(4,17,11)\">Num 17:11</ref> suffix <bdbheb>מַחְתָּתוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 10:1\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(3,10,1)\">Lev 10:1</ref>+ 4 t.; plural absolute <bdbheb>מַחְתּוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 16:6\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(4,16,6)\">Num 16:6</ref> + 4 t.; <bdbheb>מַחְתֹּת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 16:17\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(4,16,17)\">Num 16:17</ref> + 3 t.; construct <bdbheb>מַחְתּוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 17:3\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(4,17,3)\">Num 17:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 17:4\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(4,17,4)\">Num 17:4</ref> suffix <bdbheb>מַחְתֹּתָיו</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 27:3\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(2,27,3)\">Exod 27:3</ref> <bdbheb>מַחְתֹּתֶיהָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 25:38\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"38\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"38\" onclick=\"bcv(2,25,38)\">Exod 25:38</ref> + 2 t; — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>snuff-holder</highlight>, snuff-dish (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Now')\">Now<sup>Archäol. ii, 63. 65</sup></lookup>) of gold <ref ref=\"Exod 25:38\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"38\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"38\" onclick=\"bcv(2,25,38)\">Exod 25:38</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 37:23\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(2,37,23)\">Exod 37:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 4:9\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(4,4,9)\">Num 4:9</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> bronze utensils, <highlight>fire-pans</highlight>, belonging to altar of burnt-offerings <ref ref=\"Exod 27:3\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(2,27,3)\">Exod 27:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 38:3\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(2,38,3)\">Exod 38:3</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Num 4:14\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(4,4,14)\">Num 4:14</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); <highlight>fire-pans</highlight> of gold <ref ref=\"1Kgs 7:50\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"50\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"50\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,50)\">1Kgs 7:50</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Chr 4:22\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(14,4,22)\">2Chr 4:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 25:15\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(12,25,15)\">2Kgs 25:15</ref> = <ref ref=\"Jer 52:19\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"52\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"52\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(24,52,19)\">Jer 52:19</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>censer</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Lev 10:1\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(3,10,1)\">Lev 10:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 16:12\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(3,16,12)\">Lev 16:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 16:6\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(4,16,6)\">Num 16:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 16:17\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(4,16,17)\">Num 16:17</ref> (4 t. in verse); <ref ref=\"Num 16:18\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(4,16,18)\">Num 16:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 17:2\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(4,17,2)\">Num 17:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 17:3\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(4,17,3)\">Num 17:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 17:4\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(4,17,4)\">Num 17:4</ref> (of bronze), v.<ref ref=\"Num 16:11\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(4,16,11)\">Num 16:11</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>). </p></div><hr><p><bdbheb>חִתָּה</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>חַתְחַת</bdbheb> see below <bdbheb>חתת</bdbheb>. </p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Lev 16:12", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 16, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Num 17:11", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 17, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Lev 10:1",